<title>JAPAN: Mammy Mart -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mammy Mart -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    24.71		vs	   24.36</p>
<p> Operating	  846    million	  vs	  873    million</p>
<p> Current	    870    million	  vs	  910    million</p>
<p> Net		  420    million	  vs	  193    million</p>
<p> EPS		   42.92 yen	  vs	   19.69 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.50 yen	  vs	    6.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mammy Mart Corp operates a supermarket chain.</p>
</text>
